    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that i can't go back. everything is ruined. there's no way to fix what happened and there's no way to ever feel like i belong again. it feels like the version of me that people actually liked is just dead and gone. it's exhausting trying to pretend i still exist when everybody's already moved on without me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
